        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"1725da80-94f6-4874-9cfe-5cb11d011e9c\",\"review_text\":\"Find the app to be very easy to use and reliable which is very important to me thank you\"},{\"review_id\":\"d918decf-5b51-4368-ad8a-5446d5aca4ba\",\"review_text\":\"What is happening in Spotify.. The latest update sucks. Basic features are all gone.. if this continues I am going to change app\"},{\"review_id\":\"ba9059f7-e458-4e4e-9b39-23b58a3e256c\",\"review_text\":\"😡😡😡😡\"},{\"review_id\":\"ba61817f-6993-435c-8998-90b0d754a8b2\",\"review_text\":\"جميل جدا\"},{\"review_id\":\"74c7fc31-1720-435e-a3e3-4b9545c286fc\",\"review_text\":\"After update very bad experience we cannot go in back songs....and for the lyrics we have to pay money 😑\"},{\"review_id\":\"cc0b0531-6f7b-4dfa-a206-23de12d5e89f\",\"review_text\":\"I listen everyday\"},{\"review_id\":\"89288695-89cb-48e5-bde5-f1a3245ee0c6\",\"review_text\":\"Superb\"},{\"review_id\":\"727851b8-0bbb-4919-9b77-677d250fe2bc\",\"review_text\":\"Too many ads\"},{\"review_id\":\"672d3a15-4db6-46b6-86e7-fae7f63b848e\",\"review_text\":\"I had rated 5, if had an option i would hav rated 0 now.Every thing requires premium now... we can't even add to queue. It was the best app before now worsened. An award must be given to the big brain who thought they'll generate revenue for keeping premium for every single thing, instead lost customers. Its been soo many years I have used Spotify and i hav recommended many people to use. But now...today is the day i delete it and suggest other people to use a different platform to listen music.\"},{\"review_id\":\"284ca604-eb49-4f69-9057-b8dcf698ad99\",\"review_text\":\"Worst app ever\"}]}"
